WEBVTT

01:30.520 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:38.560
I want revenge.

01:38.640 --> 01:40.320
They killed the only person in this world

01:40.960 --> 01:42.000
who was ever kind to me

01:42.600 --> 01:44.080
and gave me warmth.

01:44.640 --> 01:45.920
I want power!

01:50.240 --> 01:52.600
I want the power to take revenge
on the Immortal Alliance!

01:54.080 --> 01:55.440
I want revenge!

02:01.840 --> 02:03.000
Mu Xuanling.

02:03.760 --> 02:06.080
Mu Xuanling. Mu Xuanling?

02:07.360 --> 02:08.199
Mu Xuanling.

02:08.960 --> 02:09.800
Mu Xuanling!

02:11.160 --> 02:12.320
Xie Xuechen,

02:13.560 --> 02:14.400
it hurts.

02:15.040 --> 02:15.880
I know.

02:15.960 --> 02:17.040
Stop talking.

02:26.720 --> 02:27.680
Gao Qiumin,

02:27.760 --> 02:29.040
you didn't do it on purpose.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.040
Don't feel guilty.

02:30.760 --> 02:31.600
Don't.

02:34.480 --> 02:36.400
She's given her heart to someone

02:36.480 --> 02:37.920
who doesn't value it.

02:39.640 --> 02:41.760
Miss Gao is engaged to Mr. Xie,

02:43.160 --> 02:47.040
yet Mr. Xie seems
to be entangled with Miss Mu.

02:49.840 --> 02:50.680
What a mess.

02:51.760 --> 02:52.800
Miss Gao.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.720
I heard there was
a Dark Clan sighting in the city,

03:05.280 --> 03:06.160
so I came to help.

03:06.840 --> 03:09.200
Are you all right, Miss Gao?

03:11.800 --> 03:13.800
The one she loves has fallen
for someone else.

03:13.880 --> 03:15.120
Of course, she's not all right.

03:15.640 --> 03:17.280
What a stupid question.

03:17.360 --> 03:20.160
Did he see me
mistakenly helping the Dark Clan?

03:20.680 --> 03:21.840
How embarrassing.

03:21.920 --> 03:23.520
I can't let him spread this around.

03:28.520 --> 03:29.360
No.

03:34.160 --> 03:36.040
Thank you for your concern, Mr. Fu.

03:36.120 --> 03:39.160
I didn't expect things
to turn out this way either.

03:39.240 --> 03:41.400
Please don't mention this to anyone.

03:41.480 --> 03:43.600
Of course she wouldn't want others to know

03:43.680 --> 03:44.920
that her fiancé betrayed her.

03:45.440 --> 03:46.960
Don't worry. I won't.

03:47.040 --> 03:48.680
My lips are sealed.

03:49.480 --> 03:51.000
But perhaps you should also

03:51.080 --> 03:53.080
ask Mr. Xie and Miss Mu

03:53.960 --> 03:55.120
to keep a lower profile.

03:56.840 --> 03:57.920
Is he suggesting

03:58.520 --> 04:01.520
I find a way to silence
Mu Xuanling and Xie Xuechen?

04:03.080 --> 04:05.520
I see your point, Mr. Fu.
Thank you for the advice.

04:24.800 --> 04:26.240
I'm glad she understands.

04:27.440 --> 04:28.880
It's impressive how she can

04:29.400 --> 04:30.680
face something like this

04:32.320 --> 04:34.040
without crying or causing a scene.

04:56.120 --> 04:57.040
He ran away?

05:02.800 --> 05:04.000
That can't be right.

05:04.640 --> 05:05.880
If he had the strength,

05:06.640 --> 05:08.480
he would've broken free long ago.

05:09.280 --> 05:11.120
He wouldn't have been trapped
by the curse for so long.

05:12.640 --> 05:13.800
It seems

05:14.400 --> 05:16.120
someone helped him escape.

05:55.480 --> 05:56.840
My spiritual apertures are damaged.

05:57.880 --> 05:59.040
I can't cultivate spiritual power.

06:00.800 --> 06:02.520
I knew she couldn't cultivate
spiritual power,

06:03.640 --> 06:05.560
but I didn't realize
she couldn't even absorb it.

07:02.320 --> 07:03.880
It does hurt a lot.

07:04.880 --> 07:06.520
How many years and how many times

07:07.760 --> 07:09.440
have demonic power inflicted pain

07:09.960 --> 07:11.160
on you?

07:13.360 --> 07:15.840
You transferred the injury
caused by the curse to yourself?

07:18.240 --> 07:19.080
Xie Xuechen,

07:20.400 --> 07:21.640
I didn't give you that bracelet

07:22.280 --> 07:23.320
for you to use it like that.

07:26.240 --> 07:28.720
With the Jade Vault Technique
protecting me, I'll recover quickly.

07:30.000 --> 07:30.960
But she wouldn't be able to handle it.

07:39.440 --> 07:42.000
I didn't expect you
to have a soft spot for someone.

07:44.320 --> 07:45.360
What are

07:46.320 --> 07:47.400
your true feelings for her?

07:53.240 --> 07:54.960
I brought her to Snow City

07:55.560 --> 07:57.000
and made her a disciple here.

07:58.360 --> 08:00.160
-It's my responsibility to protect her.
-Is it just responsibility,

08:01.880 --> 08:03.200
or is it something more?

08:16.560 --> 08:17.880
Take care of her for me.

08:20.120 --> 08:22.280
She'd rather you stayed here.

08:26.640 --> 08:27.840
But I

08:30.320 --> 08:32.000
can't stay here just for her.

08:52.000 --> 08:53.520
Isn't it exhausting falling

08:55.960 --> 08:57.240
for someone like him?

09:43.960 --> 09:44.800
Xuechen,

09:45.760 --> 09:48.160
the Jade Vault Technique
may have fast healing effects,

09:48.240 --> 09:50.000
but the injuries caused
by the curse are severe,

09:50.520 --> 09:51.680
and the pain is real.

09:51.760 --> 09:52.840
Why did you

09:53.800 --> 09:55.880
transfer them from Mu Xuanling
to yourself?

09:56.520 --> 09:57.920
What do you think of her
after watching her

09:58.800 --> 10:00.040
these past few days?

10:00.680 --> 10:02.760
She's rebellious
and doesn't follow the rules.

10:03.720 --> 10:05.680
She's about to rack up ten demerits.

10:07.880 --> 10:08.880
I don't think

10:10.280 --> 10:12.400
she's fit to be a disciple of Snow City.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.280
Hand me the demerit records.

10:17.720 --> 10:19.360
ONE DEMERIT TO MU XUANLING
FOR VIOLATING THE RULES

10:19.440 --> 10:20.280
ONE DEMERIT TO MU XUANLING
FOR SKIPPING A CLASS

10:23.720 --> 10:24.720
ONE DEMERIT TO MU XUANLING
FOR COOKING WITHOUT PERMISSION

10:24.800 --> 10:25.640
ONE DEMERIT TO MU XUANLING
FOR VIOLATING THE RULES

10:26.560 --> 10:27.920
Xuechen, what are you…?

10:28.640 --> 10:31.800
I didn't ask you to watch her
just to record demerits.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.600
Judge a person by their heart.

10:36.600 --> 10:38.560
-But she's from the Spirit Clan.
-That doesn't make her any different.

10:39.600 --> 10:41.160
Perhaps starting with her,

10:41.240 --> 10:42.600
the Immortal Alliance

10:43.280 --> 10:45.400
will have more and more
Spirit Clan disciples.

10:46.320 --> 10:47.440
Humans and spirits
have been at odds for millennia.

10:47.520 --> 10:49.120
What you're trying to do

10:50.560 --> 10:51.800
won't be easy.

10:51.880 --> 10:53.440
But it's possible,

10:54.280 --> 10:55.400
isn't it?

10:56.640 --> 10:57.480
It is.

11:00.240 --> 11:02.280
The Dark Clan member
in the city haven't been found yet.

11:02.880 --> 11:04.200
Order a citywide search.

11:05.040 --> 11:06.440
Leave no corner unchecked.

11:06.520 --> 11:07.360
Understood.

11:29.040 --> 11:30.400
Is this

11:30.480 --> 11:33.160
-Xie Xuechen's room?
-Mu Xuanling!

11:34.160 --> 11:35.440
Xie Xuechen,

11:36.360 --> 11:37.600
it hurts.

11:37.680 --> 11:38.760
I know.

11:39.880 --> 11:42.240
So, I was right.

11:44.440 --> 11:47.360
It really was him who carried me back.

12:03.520 --> 12:06.920
So, it takes a near-death experience
to get this kind of treatment.

12:21.200 --> 12:23.440
Miss Mu, what are you doing?

12:32.600 --> 12:33.680
It's you.

12:34.800 --> 12:37.080
Where is Xie Xuechen?

12:37.160 --> 12:38.000
The Dark Clan has infiltrated the city.

12:38.600 --> 12:40.360
As the Lord of Snow City,

12:40.440 --> 12:42.120
he has to deal with it.

12:42.200 --> 12:43.440
He asked me to take care of you.

12:46.880 --> 12:47.880
I thought you'd be upset

12:47.960 --> 12:49.200
he wasn't here.

12:50.200 --> 12:51.760
Why would I be upset?

12:52.280 --> 12:54.040
I don't expect him to stay by my side.

13:00.840 --> 13:02.080
Where's Bao?

13:02.160 --> 13:03.120
I sent her back to her quarters.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.760
To avoid terrifying her,

13:04.840 --> 13:06.840
I put her to sleep with a Calming Spell.

13:09.840 --> 13:12.520
I told her this journey would be dangerous

13:12.600 --> 13:14.840
and warned her not to follow me,
but she wouldn't listen.

13:16.160 --> 13:17.320
Thank you.

13:20.920 --> 13:23.720
The Xuantian Sect's Curse
isn't so terrible after all.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.880
I barely feel any pain now.

13:30.400 --> 13:31.240
You don't feel pain

13:32.560 --> 13:34.120
because someone else
is suffering it for you.

13:35.800 --> 13:37.520
Xuechen transferred all your injuries

13:37.600 --> 13:39.080
onto himself.

13:41.800 --> 13:43.000
My injuries

13:43.760 --> 13:45.120
are mine to bear.

13:45.200 --> 13:46.320
Who asked him to transfer them?

13:47.240 --> 13:50.040
-I'll go find him.
-Your external wounds may have healed,

13:50.120 --> 13:52.040
but the internal damage
caused by the curse is still there.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.640
You still need to rest.

13:53.720 --> 13:54.640
Besides,

13:55.440 --> 13:57.040
confronting him now

13:57.840 --> 13:58.840
won't change anything.

14:03.080 --> 14:05.360
I haven't repaid what I owe him,

14:06.040 --> 14:07.600
and now there's another debt.

14:09.480 --> 14:10.840
Did he do it on purpose?

14:15.920 --> 14:16.760
Oh well,

14:16.840 --> 14:18.280
I'll repay the debts slowly.

14:19.160 --> 14:20.720
Maybe this is the bond I need

14:21.360 --> 14:22.680
to stay by his side forever.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.360
Love

14:30.400 --> 14:32.120
is truly powerful.

14:33.840 --> 14:35.440
It can make you defy your instinct

14:36.080 --> 14:38.240
to avoid harm and seek benefit.

14:46.880 --> 14:48.160
Living

14:48.840 --> 14:50.400
never meant much to me.

14:51.080 --> 14:52.160
I never

14:52.240 --> 14:54.560
saw death as a big loss.

14:55.600 --> 14:58.440
After all, no one really cared about me.

14:59.480 --> 15:01.440
But in just one day,

15:01.520 --> 15:02.640
he taught me

15:03.320 --> 15:05.920
how to feel joy and pain.

15:07.040 --> 15:08.360
I won't let you get hurt again.

15:09.680 --> 15:11.480
Never say it doesn't hurt again.

15:19.640 --> 15:21.120
I'll take you away from here.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.720
From now on, you'll see

15:23.480 --> 15:25.480
dazzling fireworks
at every Timekeeper Festival.

15:26.640 --> 15:28.440
Everything will be all right

15:29.640 --> 15:31.000
when you open your eyes.

15:33.760 --> 15:36.160
He made me understand
the meaning of life and death.

15:40.320 --> 15:42.000
Mister!

15:43.960 --> 15:45.680
Though we spent only one day together,

15:46.400 --> 15:49.000
it was enough to sustain me
through ten years

15:49.840 --> 15:50.920
of darkness and pain

15:51.920 --> 15:53.360
in the Dark Abyss.

15:56.040 --> 15:57.200
It seems you're just

15:58.200 --> 15:59.520
clinging to that one day.

16:01.400 --> 16:03.200
But ten years have passed,

16:04.760 --> 16:05.800
and he doesn't even remember it.

16:07.400 --> 16:08.840
Do you care

16:09.680 --> 16:12.000
about the man he is now

16:13.880 --> 16:15.440
or the man he was that day?

16:16.600 --> 16:17.720
Are your feelings for him

16:18.320 --> 16:19.480
gratitude or love?

16:25.960 --> 16:27.080
What does it matter?

16:28.840 --> 16:30.640
Either way, Xie Xuechen is the one.

16:31.720 --> 16:32.760
That's all I need to know.

16:34.360 --> 16:35.960
It's just like how you feel close to me

16:36.800 --> 16:39.560
because of a brief encounter in the past.

16:58.600 --> 17:05.440
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

17:11.599 --> 17:12.800
She's devoted her life

17:14.079 --> 17:15.040
and death to him.

17:16.960 --> 17:19.000
How enviable.

17:27.119 --> 17:29.160
It's a shame we couldn't eliminate
that Dark Clan member this time.

17:29.800 --> 17:32.560
By the time Xuan Xin arrived,
he'd already disappeared.

17:33.280 --> 17:36.080
Maybe someone helped him escape.

17:39.080 --> 17:39.960
Not necessarily.

17:40.040 --> 17:41.480
It's possible that he

17:42.200 --> 17:43.640
possessed someone in time

17:44.480 --> 17:45.640
and avoided being cursed.

17:46.520 --> 17:48.680
To escape the curse,

17:49.400 --> 17:52.240
he would've had to hide deep within
the inner demons of a powerful cultivator.

17:55.040 --> 17:56.680
Who could it be?

18:00.840 --> 18:02.480
It could be a high-ranking disciple,

18:03.640 --> 18:04.560
an elder,

18:07.440 --> 18:08.280
or even a sect leader.

18:11.440 --> 18:13.800
But the protective barrier
around Snow City didn't react at all.

18:14.480 --> 18:16.920
How did he infiltrate so silently?

18:20.800 --> 18:22.600
No one-way array can breach

18:23.400 --> 18:25.120
Snow City's protective barrier.

18:25.880 --> 18:27.040
Unless

18:28.240 --> 18:30.320
someone inside the city helped form

18:30.400 --> 18:31.520
a two-way array,

18:32.880 --> 18:34.560
there's no way he could have entered.

18:39.560 --> 18:40.800
Are you saying

18:40.880 --> 18:43.840
someone in the city collaborated with him?

18:47.720 --> 18:49.120
Do you have a way

18:50.120 --> 18:51.440
to expose the Dark Clan member?

18:51.520 --> 18:52.440
There is a way.

18:52.520 --> 18:54.400
The Dark Clan relies on inner demons
to possess others.

18:54.480 --> 18:57.240
Xuantian Sect has techniques
to observe one's faith.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.360
We could examine everyone

19:00.160 --> 19:02.040
to identify those afflicted
by inner demons.

19:04.160 --> 19:05.680
Leave this to Xuan Xin.

19:06.600 --> 19:09.640
He's always been perceptive and sharp.

19:12.240 --> 19:13.320
Then I'll entrust

19:14.400 --> 19:15.520
this task to you, Xuan Xin.

19:20.080 --> 19:21.360
But a full-scale investigation

19:22.280 --> 19:23.840
might alert our target.

19:25.160 --> 19:26.680
I'll use the Dark Clan infiltration
as an excuse

19:26.760 --> 19:28.640
to bring forward
the Alliance Leader election

19:28.720 --> 19:30.200
and gather everyone
in the Hall of Integrity.

19:31.560 --> 19:32.680
During the meeting,

19:33.200 --> 19:34.600
you can discreetly observe

19:35.440 --> 19:36.920
everyone's faith

19:37.560 --> 19:38.960
to identify those with inner demons.

19:39.600 --> 19:40.440
That sounds like a good plan.

19:44.280 --> 19:45.320
Sir,

19:46.560 --> 19:48.200
I'd like to discuss

19:48.280 --> 19:49.800
the task further with Mr. Xie.

20:00.600 --> 20:01.480
Is there something on your mind, Xuan Xin?

20:02.240 --> 20:04.200
Yes, Mr. Xie.

20:05.120 --> 20:06.800
That Dark Clan member
was subdued by the curse,

20:07.640 --> 20:10.400
but when I went to find him,
he had vanished.

20:11.080 --> 20:12.320
When the sect leader
mentioned it just now,

20:13.040 --> 20:14.160
your expression changed.

20:15.080 --> 20:17.320
Does this matter involve you?

20:18.960 --> 20:20.080
Why didn't you ask earlier?

20:20.160 --> 20:22.400
Since you didn't want
the sect leader to know,

20:23.240 --> 20:25.320
I thought it was better
to speak with you privately first.

20:33.480 --> 20:34.600
Yes,

20:35.640 --> 20:36.720
I was involved.

20:37.760 --> 20:39.160
I rescued a Spirit Clan member.

20:39.680 --> 20:40.720
She once cultivated demonic power,

20:41.320 --> 20:42.680
so the curse harmed her too.

20:43.880 --> 20:46.120
But she isn't
the Dark Clan member we're after.

20:46.200 --> 20:47.640
I see.

20:48.560 --> 20:50.720
Do you trust her, Mr. Xie?

20:51.320 --> 20:52.200
I do.

20:53.160 --> 20:54.000
I trust her.

20:54.640 --> 20:55.480
In that case,

20:56.200 --> 20:57.160
I know what to do.

20:58.360 --> 20:59.960
You're not planning to purge her?

21:01.560 --> 21:04.920
That's quite different from most
Xuantian Sect cultivators.

21:07.000 --> 21:08.560
I judge people by their character.

21:10.800 --> 21:12.360
You're truly insightful.

21:47.560 --> 21:50.680
This room is as cold and lifeless
as its owner.

21:51.960 --> 21:54.880
Why don't I surprise him a little?

22:11.360 --> 22:12.560
Now this looks much better.

22:12.640 --> 22:15.640
Xie Xuechen is in for a shock
when he comes back.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.000
Ling.

22:20.560 --> 22:21.480
Ling.

22:23.360 --> 22:24.440
Ling.

22:34.720 --> 22:35.920
The Dark Abyss?

22:36.880 --> 22:39.360
How is this possible?
I was just in Snow City.

22:40.880 --> 22:42.560
It's only an illusion.

22:46.000 --> 22:47.040
No need to be alarmed.

22:49.080 --> 22:49.920
Master?

22:59.200 --> 23:00.360
Master,

23:00.440 --> 23:02.880
you're in the Dark Abyss,
and I'm in Snow City.

23:02.960 --> 23:04.600
How did you bypass Snow City's barrier

23:04.680 --> 23:07.000
and summon me into this illusion
from so far away?

23:07.720 --> 23:10.320
You've always been a troublemaker.

23:10.920 --> 23:13.360
As a precaution,

23:13.440 --> 23:14.480
I placed a spell

23:15.480 --> 23:16.560
on your heart long ago.

23:17.760 --> 23:20.200
It has a lovely name.

23:20.280 --> 23:22.120
Heartstring.

23:22.720 --> 23:24.960
It's like a thread
that binds our hearts together.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.560
With it, summoning you into an illusion

23:28.120 --> 23:29.520
is no trouble at all.

23:29.600 --> 23:30.440
So, Master,

23:30.520 --> 23:34.280
you tampered with me
without my knowledge?

23:37.440 --> 23:38.600
Master,

23:38.680 --> 23:41.400
can't there be a little trust between us?

23:46.600 --> 23:47.560
I believe

23:48.240 --> 23:50.480
trust must

23:51.880 --> 23:53.360
be earned.

23:54.080 --> 23:55.600
I still remember every word

23:56.200 --> 23:58.200
of the plan you proposed that day.

23:59.440 --> 24:01.360
For someone unafraid of death,

24:01.880 --> 24:03.160
keeping him locked up is pointless.

24:03.920 --> 24:04.960
Master,

24:06.200 --> 24:07.720
why not try my plan?

24:08.600 --> 24:10.920
I'll rescue him, stay close to him,

24:11.000 --> 24:12.240
gain his trust,

24:12.320 --> 24:13.680
and lull him into letting his guard down.

24:14.520 --> 24:17.360
Then I'll find a chance
to seize the Chaos Pearl

24:17.440 --> 24:18.640
and destroy the Immortal Alliance.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.560
Here's the Half-Day Glory.

24:21.480 --> 24:22.360
Take it.

24:24.080 --> 24:25.600
And now,

24:26.360 --> 24:27.480
what have you accomplished?

24:29.760 --> 24:30.800
I've rescued him,

24:30.880 --> 24:33.080
stayed close to him, gained his trust,

24:33.160 --> 24:34.480
and lulled him
into letting his guard down.

24:35.080 --> 24:36.600
I've already accomplished so much.

24:43.640 --> 24:46.400
Don't try to fool me

24:46.480 --> 24:48.800
with clever words.

24:50.680 --> 24:54.040
You've spent far too much time

24:54.120 --> 24:55.360
on Xie Xuechen.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.400
It makes me wonder

24:58.440 --> 25:00.680
if you've betrayed me.

25:07.680 --> 25:08.800
How could I?

25:09.880 --> 25:12.400
Master, you saved me
from the Immortal Alliance's blade,

25:13.520 --> 25:15.920
taught me demonic techniques,
gave me power,

25:16.000 --> 25:18.560
and granted me status in the Dark Abyss.

25:18.640 --> 25:19.920
I would never betray you.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.080
Good.

25:30.000 --> 25:32.240
Then prove it.

25:32.920 --> 25:35.000
How do you want me to prove it, Master?

25:35.680 --> 25:37.040
Bring back the Chaos Pearl.

25:37.120 --> 25:39.160
Then, kill Xie Xuechen.

25:47.040 --> 25:48.920
Seeing that look on your face,

25:49.000 --> 25:49.840
I'm

25:51.360 --> 25:53.040
truly disappointed.

25:54.240 --> 25:56.040
Let me remind you of something.

25:56.920 --> 25:59.360
Your demonic power requires you

25:59.960 --> 26:01.880
to temper your body with demonic energy

26:01.960 --> 26:03.960
in the Dark Abyss at least once a month.

26:04.480 --> 26:06.000
If you fail to do it,

26:06.080 --> 26:08.800
the power will backfire on you.

26:09.600 --> 26:11.040
With your damaged spiritual apertures,

26:11.560 --> 26:13.000
you won't be able to take it.

26:13.080 --> 26:15.960
You'll die from an internal explosion.

26:19.400 --> 26:21.360
No wonder you agreed

26:21.880 --> 26:23.720
to my plan so easily back then.

26:24.520 --> 26:25.920
You have a backup plan,

26:27.080 --> 26:28.000
and your trump card

26:28.640 --> 26:29.560
is my life.

26:29.640 --> 26:30.880
What?

26:31.800 --> 26:33.480
Are you willing to throw away

26:34.080 --> 26:35.600
your own life for Xie Xuechen?

26:38.800 --> 26:39.800
Of course not.

26:40.440 --> 26:42.360
Spirits live for thousands of years.

26:43.200 --> 26:46.320
The world is vast,
and there are countless men.

26:46.400 --> 26:48.880
Why would I throw my life away
for just one man?

26:50.280 --> 26:52.640
I was just having fun with him.

26:52.720 --> 26:54.560
Rest assured, Master.

26:54.640 --> 26:55.880
I'll complete the mission.

26:56.480 --> 26:58.080
I'll retrieve the Chaos Pearl

26:58.160 --> 26:59.680
and kill Xie Xuechen.

27:00.600 --> 27:01.840
Good.

27:01.920 --> 27:03.280
I'll be waiting.

27:04.640 --> 27:07.360
But it's hard to act alone.

27:08.120 --> 27:09.200
Master,

27:09.280 --> 27:11.120
are the Ignorance Demon and people
from the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

27:11.200 --> 27:12.720
in Snow City right now?

27:13.240 --> 27:15.080
Where are they? Let them lend me a hand.

27:17.320 --> 27:19.160
Do you want their help,

27:20.040 --> 27:20.880
or are you planning

27:20.960 --> 27:22.840
to eliminate them all at once?

27:24.360 --> 27:26.120
If you don't trust me, Master,

27:26.200 --> 27:27.880
just take my life now.

27:28.760 --> 27:30.840
Don't be upset.

27:32.520 --> 27:33.960
We've been master and disciple
for ten years.

27:34.560 --> 27:36.120
As long as you complete the mission,

27:37.280 --> 27:38.800
nothing will change.

27:39.560 --> 27:40.680
Remember,

27:41.840 --> 27:43.440
we were born in the darkness.

27:44.400 --> 27:47.200
Don't deceive yourself into thinking
you can live in the light.

27:51.880 --> 27:53.000
I learned this truth

27:53.520 --> 27:55.360
the hard way

27:56.400 --> 27:59.360
20 years ago, and it cost me an arm.

28:00.840 --> 28:01.960
Ling,

28:02.720 --> 28:04.080
I hope you'll

28:04.800 --> 28:05.920
understand it too.

28:08.720 --> 28:09.600
Now go.

28:09.680 --> 28:11.400
Complete your mission.

28:11.480 --> 28:13.120
I'll be waiting for you at home.

28:36.680 --> 28:38.840
Even the slightest pretense
makes a show fake.

28:38.920 --> 28:40.440
Then I'll devote myself to it fully.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.360
Here's the Half-Day Glory.

28:43.440 --> 28:44.440
Take it.

28:45.440 --> 28:47.120
My act is flawless,

28:47.200 --> 28:48.760
so even Master has been fooled.

28:48.840 --> 28:49.960
Master,

28:50.680 --> 28:53.040
thank you for capturing him.

28:53.120 --> 28:54.720
Otherwise, I wouldn't have known

28:55.280 --> 28:56.800
he was still alive.

29:03.160 --> 29:04.240
It's been ten years.

29:04.320 --> 29:05.680
Now we're reunited in the Dark Abyss.

29:06.200 --> 29:08.880
Hello, Mister.

29:13.240 --> 29:15.720
So, you are the Young Lord of Snow City,

29:16.240 --> 29:17.160
Xie Xuechen, huh?

29:21.280 --> 29:23.240
You truly

29:23.320 --> 29:25.400
are unbelievably handsome.

29:25.480 --> 29:26.920
Everyone would be captivated by you.

29:28.640 --> 29:30.080
Have we met somewhere before?

29:33.000 --> 29:34.160
Too bad we got off

29:34.800 --> 29:37.040
on the wrong foot again.

29:38.000 --> 29:39.280
But that's fine.

29:39.360 --> 29:40.520
This time,

29:40.600 --> 29:42.080
I'll be the one to protect you.

29:46.600 --> 29:47.600
So, everything

29:49.400 --> 29:51.160
has just been my foolish wishful thinking.

30:24.000 --> 30:27.440
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

30:48.280 --> 30:50.680
Mu Xuanling, I brought you…

30:55.800 --> 30:56.800
Where is she?

31:12.560 --> 31:13.560
She's gone?

31:16.040 --> 31:17.600
Did I come back too late?

31:25.040 --> 31:26.320
Is she inside?

31:31.720 --> 31:33.680
Mu Xuanling, I'm here to apologize.

31:35.240 --> 31:38.040
No, that's too arrogant.
She'd probably beat me up for that.

31:42.760 --> 31:44.360
Xuanling,

31:44.440 --> 31:46.360
about what happened today,
I misunderstood you,

31:46.440 --> 31:49.120
and you got hurt because of me. I'm sorry.

31:50.120 --> 31:52.800
That won't work either.
Mu Xuanling is so proud.

31:52.880 --> 31:54.240
If she sees me being this submissive,

31:54.320 --> 31:56.080
she'll definitely make fun of me.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.480
Mu Xuanling,

32:00.560 --> 32:02.600
I know you caught me in the wrong today,

32:02.680 --> 32:05.640
but don't forget
I've got something on you, too.

32:06.160 --> 32:07.640
If you keep my secret,

32:07.720 --> 32:08.720
I'll keep yours.

32:09.400 --> 32:10.520
Deal?

32:13.760 --> 32:14.600
What do you think I'd say?

32:17.560 --> 32:20.080
Why are you back so late?
I've been waiting here for ages.

32:23.200 --> 32:24.920
Aren't you going to ask me
why I waited so long for you?

32:33.720 --> 32:35.600
I'm in a foul mood,

32:35.680 --> 32:37.320
and I feel like taking it out on someone.

32:37.400 --> 32:39.840
If you don't leave now, I'll kill you.

32:40.760 --> 32:42.240
Why are you like this, Mu Xuanling?

32:42.320 --> 32:44.320
I came here to apologize!

32:45.480 --> 32:46.720
I was wrong.

32:47.440 --> 32:48.360
I misunderstood you today.

32:50.080 --> 32:51.200
This is my favorite artifact.

32:51.880 --> 32:53.280
It can create beautiful dreams.

32:53.880 --> 32:55.440
I'm giving it to you. Also,

32:55.520 --> 32:57.120
I brought back your sword, too.

32:57.760 --> 32:59.640
Let's just forget what happened today.

32:59.720 --> 33:00.880
Please don't tell anyone about it.

33:03.720 --> 33:05.760
So, you're just scared
I'll tell people you accidentally helped

33:05.840 --> 33:07.600
the Dark Clan and ruin your reputation.

33:07.680 --> 33:08.960
You're not really sorry.

33:09.560 --> 33:11.280
You're just apologizing for your own good.

33:12.640 --> 33:15.880
Mu Xuanling, don't forget
I've got dirt on you, too.

33:15.960 --> 33:17.000
I could tell everyone that you're…

33:17.960 --> 33:19.160
a Spirit Clan member cultivating
demonic power.

33:19.240 --> 33:20.960
Go ahead. Tell everyone.

33:21.040 --> 33:21.880
Tell them right now.

33:21.960 --> 33:23.880
Are you insane? You'll die!

33:23.960 --> 33:24.800
Ending things sooner isn't so bad.

33:26.880 --> 33:28.760
Are you done talking? If so, leave.

33:28.840 --> 33:30.480
Stop annoying me.

33:35.760 --> 33:38.560
Mu Xuanling, I'm just worried about you.

33:47.960 --> 33:49.200
Xuanling,

33:49.280 --> 33:51.840
that horrible woman
waited outside for two hours.

33:51.920 --> 33:53.440
She kept muttering to herself,

33:53.520 --> 33:55.760
practicing how to apologize to you.

33:55.840 --> 33:57.520
It was so satisfying to watch!

33:59.400 --> 34:00.880
Xuanling, what's wrong?

34:06.040 --> 34:07.200
Bao,

34:08.040 --> 34:10.800
if I die one day,

34:11.600 --> 34:13.800
go to the Jade Sky Palace
with Fu Lansheng, all right?

34:13.880 --> 34:15.880
Why would you die, Xuanling?

34:15.960 --> 34:18.400
Did that Dark Clan member hurt you today?

34:18.480 --> 34:20.280
I'll go find you
spiritual herbs right now.

34:21.880 --> 34:23.960
No, I was just joking.

34:24.840 --> 34:26.400
I just thought,

34:26.480 --> 34:27.679
since the Master
of the Jade Sky Palace is surnamed Fu,

34:27.760 --> 34:29.159
maybe your father really is there.

34:29.760 --> 34:31.840
I'll look for my father,
but you can't die, Xuanling.

34:31.920 --> 34:32.920
You can't!

34:34.760 --> 34:37.679
Bao, the Spirit Clan has long lifespans,

34:37.760 --> 34:39.120
but everyone dies eventually.

34:39.199 --> 34:41.600
You need to learn to face it.

34:43.000 --> 34:44.840
That's still a long, long way off.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.920
Let's not talk about it now.
It's bad luck!

34:47.560 --> 34:48.400
All right.

34:48.920 --> 34:50.280
It's been a long day.
I'm dying for some rest.

34:50.360 --> 34:51.520
Let's go to bed.

34:52.320 --> 34:53.800
No more talk about death!

34:56.000 --> 34:57.320
I'm exhausted.

34:58.720 --> 35:00.000
-Time to sleep.
-Okay.

35:01.080 --> 35:03.360
Unbelievable. I went to apologize,

35:03.440 --> 35:04.600
but she was so rude to me!

35:05.120 --> 35:06.560
Qiumin, what's wrong?

35:06.640 --> 35:07.920
Did someone upset you?

35:08.000 --> 35:09.880
Of course not.

35:09.960 --> 35:12.160
I'm the Young Madam
of the Mirage Palace, after all.

35:12.240 --> 35:13.320
Stop making baseless assumptions.

35:13.400 --> 35:15.360
Right, right. You're absolutely right.

35:15.440 --> 35:16.640
It's late.

35:16.720 --> 35:17.960
Go get some rest.

35:24.880 --> 35:26.560
She's always so high and mighty.

35:26.640 --> 35:28.720
She really thinks
she's the center of the world.

35:28.800 --> 35:29.920
Exactly.

35:30.000 --> 35:32.240
At the end of the day,
she's just an orphan

35:32.320 --> 35:33.920
whose entire family has been wiped out.

35:34.560 --> 35:37.000
If Master didn't favor her,
no one would care about her.

35:37.920 --> 35:38.960
Let's go.

36:06.960 --> 36:10.160
That's not how a Snow City disciple
should handle a sword.

36:12.200 --> 36:13.440
Then teach me.

36:13.520 --> 36:14.880
Sure.

37:45.320 --> 37:46.800
The Xuanling Tree is blooming.

37:48.520 --> 37:50.240
If it can bloom in the human realm,

37:50.840 --> 37:51.880
so can you,

37:53.120 --> 37:53.960
Mu Xuanling.

37:54.560 --> 37:55.640
Xie Xuechen,

37:56.160 --> 37:58.120
which is more important to you,
the Chaos Pearl or me?

37:58.200 --> 37:59.400
Of course, it's you.

38:00.000 --> 38:02.400
Then, if I stole the Chaos Pearl one day

38:02.480 --> 38:04.800
and helped Sang Qi bring
the Dark Clan into the human realm,

38:04.880 --> 38:06.960
-would you kill me?
-No.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.600
I'd never raise my sword against you.

38:10.320 --> 38:11.640
What if the Immortal Alliance
wanted to kill me?

38:11.720 --> 38:13.200
I wouldn't let them.

38:13.840 --> 38:15.400
Then you'd become their enemy.

38:15.480 --> 38:17.680
Then so be it.

38:22.400 --> 38:23.520
Xie Xuechen,

38:24.640 --> 38:25.600
do you love me?

38:26.440 --> 38:27.520
I do.

38:28.440 --> 38:29.480
Deeply.

38:43.680 --> 38:45.120
The real Xie Xuechen

38:45.640 --> 38:47.200
would never say something like that.

38:48.240 --> 38:50.040
It's all in my head.

38:50.800 --> 38:52.080
It's just a dream

38:52.680 --> 38:53.960
that will never come true.

39:08.320 --> 39:09.480
Master.

39:12.200 --> 39:15.080
What brings you here

39:15.600 --> 39:16.520
so late at night?

39:18.320 --> 39:20.080
I spoke with Fajian earlier

39:21.240 --> 39:24.520
and learned that you'd be observing faith
in the Hall of Integrity tomorrow.

39:25.120 --> 39:27.720
-That's right.
-Faith observation requires

39:28.240 --> 39:29.960
a significant amount of spiritual power.

39:38.720 --> 39:40.080
Here's a seal I've created.

39:40.160 --> 39:42.960
It will assist you with the task. Take it.

39:43.040 --> 39:44.840
But won't using it

39:44.920 --> 39:46.240
drain your spiritual power, Master?

39:48.400 --> 39:51.000
You're my disciple,
raised and taught by me.

39:51.800 --> 39:53.720
It's my duty to protect you.

39:55.240 --> 39:58.080
With the Dark Clan lurking in Snow City,

39:58.160 --> 39:59.360
your priority is to protect yourself

40:00.000 --> 40:02.040
and give them no chance to harm you.

40:04.880 --> 40:05.800
Thank you, Master.

40:24.720 --> 40:28.440
HALL OF INTEGRITY

40:32.880 --> 40:34.200
As you probably all know,

40:35.240 --> 40:36.640
a Dark Clan member infiltrated
Snow City yesterday,

40:37.240 --> 40:38.400
and he remains at large.

40:39.880 --> 40:42.440
With danger looming,
we can no longer delay

40:43.040 --> 40:44.400
the election of a new Alliance Leader.

40:45.560 --> 40:48.680
I've gathered you here today
to propose that we

40:48.760 --> 40:50.200
choose a new leader immediately.

40:54.160 --> 40:55.240
Does anyone

40:56.400 --> 40:57.440
have a candidate in mind?

41:00.000 --> 41:01.840
My stance remains unchanged.

41:01.920 --> 41:03.040
I believe

41:03.120 --> 41:05.840
I am the most suitable for the position.

41:07.320 --> 41:09.640
Sending the Chaos Pearl
to the Mirage Palace?

41:10.520 --> 41:12.360
We might as well skip the trouble

41:12.440 --> 41:14.760
and hand it over
to the Dark Abyss directly.

41:15.960 --> 41:18.560
Is the Jade Sky Palace
interested in the position too?

41:19.720 --> 41:21.320
Besides wealth and treasure,
what else does it have to offer?

41:22.120 --> 41:25.080
Or do you plan to bribe Sang Qi?

41:28.480 --> 41:32.160
Who do you suggest, Mr. Xie?

41:33.360 --> 41:34.480
I believe

41:36.640 --> 41:38.040
Saint Fajian,
with his virtue and standing,

41:39.080 --> 41:40.160
is the best candidate.

41:50.000 --> 41:51.240
Thank you, Mr. Xie,

41:51.760 --> 41:54.360
but I am not the right choice.

41:54.440 --> 41:55.560
Please consider someone else.

41:56.320 --> 41:57.680
Don't decline, Fajian.

41:57.760 --> 42:00.560
No one in the Immortal Alliance
is more qualified than you.

42:01.720 --> 42:02.840
I agree.

42:04.440 --> 42:07.080
Saint Fajian's virtue and standing

42:07.600 --> 42:10.160
make him the ideal leader.

42:11.480 --> 42:12.320
Osprey Island

42:12.400 --> 42:14.000
nominates Saint Fajian

42:14.080 --> 42:16.320
as the Alliance Leader.

42:23.760 --> 42:26.520
If Saint Fajian were to lead,

42:26.600 --> 42:29.520
the Jade Sky Palace
would fully support him.

42:29.600 --> 42:31.600
Please accept the position, sir.

42:39.160 --> 42:41.520
The Mirage Palace has no objections.

42:51.360 --> 42:53.120
Since everyone has such confidence in me,

42:53.200 --> 42:54.360
I will not decline.

43:00.000 --> 43:02.200
Congratulations, sir!
